-D4E8B9CFDDED","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"結局視覚的にわかりやすく設定できた方が嬉しいってなってしまう","ts":"1620862095.389900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hvS9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CC19CBF8-969B-44D9-920D-F4AAA0F64BC0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"cron全然使わないから覚えられない","ts":"1620862057.388700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"koan"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c16e88c-231f-4566-b6c0-31013be0bd42","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"cronの式で設定できると最強。。？","ts":"1620860372.388100","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1620860396.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RUkF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f8e7a5c-c45c-4251-8027-3704cef828ed","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"引数の順序とかは英語に則ってるんで特に迷わないんですが、個々の構文要素に何が書けて何が書けないのか分からないということですね。あと登録に失敗したときキャンセルするのが面倒（「この内容で登録するけどいい？」的なダイアログがほしい）","ts":"1620859416.387900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Te/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bed25fd-5413-4dde-aabb-fc9e8c1e8651","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"自然言語寄り過ぎて使いにくいというのはわかる。\n特に repeat condition に感じるんですが、何ができて何ができないのか明確じゃないんですよね。「隔週火曜日 (every other Tuesday)」とかやりたかったけど登録が変になっちゃった記憶があります。\nちゃんと BNF 明示してほしい。あと不正な日時指定があったらエラー出してほしい","ts":"1620859187.387800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6C8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A559B5E5-6115-49BD-B228-33FFA23E0680","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"一回のみならシンプルだけど、繰り返しとか覚えられないんだよなぁ…","ts":"1620854858.387700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O4Rw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81d3232d-6171-4b47-a800-77afb92c01ef",